ard F, Herve C, Brun-Buisson C, Duvaldestin P. Discrepancies between perceptions by physicians and nursing staff of intensive care unit end-of-life decisions. Am J Respir Crit Care Med. 2003;167:1310–1315. doi: 10.1164/rccm.200207-752OC. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ]',126,'2025-10-15 11:17:37','2025-10-15 11:17:37');
